clo3d-mcp-extended
==================

This project is derived from clo3d-mcp by Violet Sphinx (Ubani-Studio), released
under the MIT licence:

  https://github.com/Ubani-Studio/clo3d-mcp

The original repository also ships interface headers and sample sources from CLO
Virtual Fashion Inc. in `sdk/`. They are NOT included here: this project is pure
Python and does not need them. CLO's own API documentation is public:

  https://developer.clo3d.com/

CLO3D is a trademark of CLO Virtual Fashion Inc. This project is not affiliated
with, sponsored or endorsed by CLO Virtual Fashion Inc. You need your own CLO3D
licence to use it.
